OL,3,AThousands without power and some
OL,4,Aflights cancelled as Storm Austen
OL,5,Alashes South West England
OL,6,
OL,7,FCornwall and parts of Devon are under
OL,8,Fan amber weather warning for strong
OL,9,Fwinds. A yellow rain warning is in
OL,10,Fplace in parts of Scotland, including
OL,11,Fthe Lothian Borders
OL,13,FAll schools in Jersey and Guernsey are
OL,14,Fclosed. A number of schools are also
OL,15,Fclosed or opening late in Cornwall
OL,17,FA further yellow weather warning for
OL,18,Fwind is kicking in from 10:00 for
OL,19,Fmillions across the South East and
OL,20,FNorth West of England, the East
OL,21,FMidlands and Wales
